values": ["[Intro]\n(Distorted guitar riff builds up)\n(Heavy drum fill)\n(Energetic bass line)\n\n[Verse 1]\n乌云在大地 投下沉重的影\n狂风在耳边 肆意地轰鸣\n你低着头 走在泥泞的路径\n满身的疲惫 掩盖了眼睛\n但别让寒冷 冻结了你的心\n这只是黎明前 暂时的寂静\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n雷声是鼓点 闪电是指引\n挺起你的胸膛 别向命运认命\n听那风声 正在逐渐平息\n\n[Chorus]\n阳光总在风雨后\n请相信有彩虹 在尽头守候\n所有的泪水 都会化作星斗\n照亮你 曾经孤独的奋斗\n阳光总在风雨后\n逆风的翅膀 才更有力挥动\n跨越了巅峰 握紧你的梦\n世界在为你 尽情地嘶吼\n\n[Verse 2]\n伤痕是勋章 刻在你的脊梁\n汗水在发烫 闪烁着光芒\n谁说平凡 无法活得像太阳\n只要你敢 逆着浪花去远航\n看那地平线 已经透出金黄\n\n[Bridge]\n(Guitar Solo - Fast and Passionate)\n不经受磨砺 怎能见锋芒\n不经历黑暗 怎知光的力量\n去奔跑吧 像从未受伤一样！\n\n[Chorus]\n阳光总在风雨后\n请相信有彩虹 在尽头守候\n所有的泪水 都会化作星斗\n照亮你 曾经孤独的奋斗\n阳光总在风雨后\n逆风的翅膀 才更有力挥动\n跨越了巅峰 握紧你的梦\n世界在为你 尽情地嘶吼\n\n[Outro]\n(Drum roll)\n阳光总在风雨后\n就在风雨后...\n(Final power chord)\n(Fade out)"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [21], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-547.8757934570312, 690.5660400390625], "widgets_values": ["Pop Rock, Uplifting, Energetic, Electric Guitar Riffs, Driving Drums, Powerful Male Vocals, Inspiring, 120 BPM, Anthemic"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "any_output", "links": [14], "label": "any_output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "any_output"}], "size": [270, 78], "pos": [1220.8065185546875, 238.92034912109375], "widgets_values": [true], "inputs": [{"name": "value_a", "link": 20, "label": "value_a", "type": "*", "localized_name": "value_a"}, {"name": "value_b", "link": 22, "label": "value_b", "type": "*", "localized_name": "value_b"}, {"widget": {"name": "inp